  message: "PR #2261 adds createBrowserRouter/createHashRouter/createMemoryRouter/createRoutesFromElements detection. Now covers: (1) JSX <Route path> (PR #2127), (2) v6.4+ object-based route configs with nested children path composition (PR #2261). Remaining unverified: lazy routes (React.lazy + dynamic import), route loader/action detection. Priority stays P3 since the two most common patterns are now covered."  # 2e36
