  message: "Two most common React Router patterns now covered: JSX <Route path> (PR #2127) and createBrowserRouter object configs (PR #2261). Remaining gaps: lazy routes (React.lazy + dynamic import) and loader/action detection. These are increasingly niche patterns. Human decision needed: is the current coverage sufficient, or should we invest in lazy route detection?"  # 3a79
